 "text": "Treasurer | Wichita County, KS\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nDepartments\nVisitors\nSearch\nDriver's License\nResources\nTax\nTax Calendar\nTax Payment Online\nTax Search\nVehicle Registration\nHome\nDepartments\nTreasurer\nTreasurer\nResponsibilities\nThe County Treasurer's Office serves as the conduit for the County's financial transactions. In addition to being the County's Financial Officer, the Treasurer's Office provides many services and information on property taxes, motor vehicle registration, vehicle title changes, and driver's license renewals. The County Treasurer is an elected official and serves a four-year term.\nThe Treasurer's Office is responsible for the collection of property taxes on real estate and personal property. During the year, the Treasurer is required to disburse collected tax money to the various taxing units (city, school districts, etc.) for their use.\nThis office also serves as an agent for the State of Kansas for registering and titling motor vehicles and renewing driver's licenses.\nContact Us\nCarol Laws\nTreasurer\nEmail Carol Laws\nTreasurer\nPhysical Address\nWichita County Courthouse\n206 South 4th Street\nLeoti , KS 67861\nMailing Address\nP.O. Box 488\nLeoti , KS 67861\nPhone: 620-375-2715\nFax: 620-375-4350\nEmergency Phone: 888-228-5142\nHours\nMonday through Friday\n8:00am to 12:00pm\n1:00pm to 4:30pm\nDriver's License\n8:00am to 12:00pm\n1:00pm to 4:00pm\nDirectory\nAppraiser\nCounty Clerk\nElections\nRegister of Deeds\nTreasurer\nPay Taxes\nWichita County\nCounty Offices\n206 South 4th Street\nLeoti, Kansas 67861\nCounty Commissioners\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHome\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nSite Map\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×",
